e tried the demo! I really appreciate it! Here's a quick update video with some of the changes being made for launch! It's going to be part of next fest, so hopefully, more people get to try the game!Go follow my Twitter if you're interested in any of the stuff I'm working on.Thanks for reading! https://x.com/HENRY_MEAD_","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T16:51:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930525","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5026390-1843481262695897","game_id":"steam-5026390","kind":"announcement","title":"the Cobble Climber Demo is OUT NOW!","summary":"It's been a while since the last update! We've reached over 50 wishlists and the number is steadily climbing! Thanks for all the kind words on my recent video.If there are any bugs or glitches that you encounter in the demo, please let me know by messaging me on X @HENRY_MEAD_. I aim to continually update the demo before the final release later this year. game changessince the last update, I've been working on overall polish and UI. Also, I've added vibration to the controller which make it feel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T16:58:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262695897","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5026390-1841579228676460","game_id":"steam-5026390","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Release Date and Time","summary":"The Cobble Climber Demo is coming 11th September!Check out this awesome artwork by Skeff https://x.com/skeff_filmI've been hard at work completing the demo portion of Cobble Climber. It will release 11th September, 6pm GMT! It will also be part of the Steam Next Fest in October. Anyway, thanks for all the exposure on Twitter! It's really helped push the project forward and I'm excited to see you all play the full version when it releases (release date soon).This is a clip that shows the art prog","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T19:13:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228676460","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5026390-1840310314355154","game_id":"steam-5026390","kind":"announcement","title":"COBBLE CLIMBER is COMING SOON","summary":"Thanks for checking the steam page out!Please Wishlist the game, it would help me out A LOT!Cobble climber is a difficult game about a prisoner attempting to escape a huge well. It has simple but frustrating controls. You control the left and right hands using the mouse as you slowly make your way up this vertical structure.About the projectI built the prototype during the GMTK jam 2026 and decided to complete the game by increasing the size of the level tenfold, improving the gameplay, and addi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T21:25:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314355154","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5026390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5026390":"2026-10-26T07:16:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5026390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:15Z"},"5035930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:16Z","last_success_at":